9	 * Shows grouped inspection findings (AOG, Open, Deferred, Pending Signoff,
10	 * Closed) with a sliding detail panel, log entry form, deferral sub-form,
11	 * and A&P sign-off flow with AI assistance.
12	 *
13	 * Route: /maintenance-hub/fleet/:equipmentId/discrepancy-log
14	 * ============================================================================
15	 */
16	
